sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant Frontend
    participant API
    participant Database

    Browser->>Frontend: Submit credentials
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/auth/login
    API->>Database: Lookup or create user & store links
    Database-->>API: User + stores
    API-->>Frontend: JWT (sub, exp, stores[])
    Frontend->>Browser: Persist token & selected store
    Browser->>Frontend: Trigger protected request
    Frontend->>API: /api/v1/* with Authorization + store_id
    API->>API: Decode JWT and verify expiry/claims
    API->>Database: Ensure subject has store access
    Database-->>API: Authorized store ids
    API-->>Frontend: Authorized response + audit event
